{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*This game is currently in development. Game content, images, and videos are subject to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pass numbered chips through the calculator and create new ones!</strong><br>Give commands to CPUs and generate as many numbers as possible in this resource management calculation game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522870/extras/play.gif?t=1744862497\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[Key Features]</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No need to worry if you're not good at math\u2014there's no game over!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Comes with a notepad and calculator, making it accessible to everyone!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're good at math, aim for even higher scores!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522870/extras/platinum.png?t=1744862497\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[Gameplay]</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple controls!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click on a chip \u2192 Click on its destination</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the calculator to create new numbers! (e.g., 1+2=3)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Match the required numbers by creating the right chips!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Submit a certain number of chips to clear the level!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[Game Highlights]</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of calculations to challenge your brain!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more you calculate, the more satisfying it feels!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3522870?t=1744862497","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepa